{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、こんにちは~︎︎︎︎︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 新4期生 岩手県出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3F3HSMRXEXK7X34GDQTCE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮った写真に落書きしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落書きは楽しいです。\n絵を書くのは苦手です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3F4GJXPE8AVQC38MHKEWB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n(元写真)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を書くのは苦手です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ3F5G3H9ARRRFYVKD17JYG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔の絵です。小学生かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下手すぎる！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵が上手な方は本当に尊敬します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも学校だったの美術とかは\n苦労してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超超超超苦手です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまらなくてごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を書くのは苦手だけど、\n写真の上から